WEBVTT

00:01:55.071 --> 00:02:02.431
Letra e palosur ne tre. Palos...

00:02:02.431 --> 00:02:03.983
U thane.

00:02:03.983 --> 00:02:08.215
(duartrokitje)

00:02:08.215 --> 00:02:13.429
Publiku: Shkund.

00:02:13.429 --> 00:02:16.361
Palos.

00:02:16.361 --> 00:02:18.939
JS: Ajo qe pritet vete. Palos. 
Palosja eshte e rendesishme

00:02:18.939 --> 00:02:23.821
sepse lejon pezullimin e ndermjetem.

00:02:23.821 --> 00:02:26.299
Kete pjese nuk duhet me doemos t'a kujtoni, 
thjesht besojeni.

00:02:26.299 --> 00:02:31.352
(te qeshura)